        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Employees assigned long distance transports will be permitted to eat their meal while on duty; time will count as time worked. There will be an eight (8)-hour break between the end of one (1) day and the beginning of the next work day except in emergencies, or unforeseen circumstances while on out-of-state trips, or when requested by the employee and where safety and security is not compromised.",
            "block_bbox": [
