            "block_content": "Bidding is only for shift and days off. Security employees that have completed trial service may bid in order of seniority as defined by Article 25, Section 9. Bidding will occur every six (6) months, becoming effective on the first Sunday of April and October. Bids must be in writing, signed by the bidding employee.",
